h251 lt i251 p3
o251 and p4 h251
b251 get p1 i251
c251 get m251 n251
u251 select o251 b251 c251
m252 set m251 n251 u251
a251 add n251 1
n252 select o251 a251 n251
i252 add p2 252
h252 lt i252 p3
o252 and p4 h252
b252 get p1 i252
