end
# `cunit` (emit_c.a0) with this emitter: lex, parse and check the source p1 of p2 bytes,
# functions [p4, nfns) checked given the bounds p3 (p5 strict), and their assembly written when
# there is no diagnostic (the prelude when p6). (io code fstat nfns). The front end is repeated
# here, not shared: its tables together are over the 2^21-bit bound of one aggregate, so they
# cannot be returned from a common function.
fn qunit io u32x512x64 u32 u32x128x8 u32 bool bool -> (io,u32,u32x128x8,u32)
lx call lexsrc p1 p2
toks at lx 0
nw at lx 1
ntok div nw 3
s1 call pass1 p1 toks ntok
sinfo at s1 1
ta at s1 2
tv at s1 3
hdrs at s1 5
nsym at s1 7
umode at s1 10
uerr at s1 11
uetok at s1 12
nhdr at s1 15
uopen ne umode 0
uerr0 eq uerr 0
ueof and uerr0 uopen
e1 select ueof 1 uerr
et1 select ueof ntok uetok
s2 call pass2 p1 sinfo nsym
pool at s2 0
s3 call pass3 p1 toks ta hdrs nhdr e1 et1 ntok
types at s3 0
tlist at s3 2
hout at s3 4
ntypes at s3 5
ntlist at s3 6
e3 at s3 11
et3 at s3 12
nhc at s3 18
nhn at s3 19
s4 call pass4 hout nhn nhc
fns0 at s4 0
names at s4 1
derr at s4 2
dtok at s4 3
dup ne derr 0
e4 select dup derr e3
et4 select dup dtok et3
s5 call pass5 fns0 names p1 toks ta tv ntok e4 et4 0
fns at s5 0
nodes at s5 1
alo at s5 2
narg at s5 5
args call bodyargs alo narg fns0 names p1 toks ta tv ntok e4 et4
fcs at s1 7
fcu at s1 8
fcp at s2 1
fch at s3 19
fct at s3 5
fcl at s3 6
fcn at s5 4
ovr call fecap toks ntok fcs fcp fcu fch fct fcl fcn narg
pcode0 at s5 8
pcode select ovr 4 pcode0
# after a parse error the function count may be below p4: nothing is checked then
cfrom call cumin p4 nhc
ck call checkir types tlist fns nodes args p3 ntypes ntlist nhc cfrom
types2 at ck 0
tlist2 at ck 2
ntys at ck 4
fstat at ck 7
ntypes2 at ck 8
cerr at ck 10
ns127 add nsym 127
nsp shr ns127 7
z64 call z64
st0 rec z64 0
st fold cstpg nsp st0 sinfo
starts at st 0
z16 call z16
fnm fold cfnm nhc z16 fns sinfo starts
grew ne ntypes2 ntypes
added and grew p5
pok eq pcode 0
c1 select added 5 0
cok eq cerr 0
c2 select cok c1 cerr
code select pok c2 pcode
ok eq code 0
go select ok 1 0
hw select p6 1 0
t fold qemst go p0 types2 tlist2 fns nodes args ntys pool fnm ntypes2 p4 nhc hw
r rec t code fstat nhc
ret r
end
